-Shift-D hotkey.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/readium\/input","role":"article"},"doc://Readium/documentation/Readium/Readium-LCP":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/Readium\/Readium-LCP","kind":"article","title":"Supporting Readium LCP","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use the Readium Swift toolkit to download and read publications that are protected with the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/www.edrlab.org\/readium-lcp\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" DRM."}],"url":"\/documentation\/readium\/readium-lcp","role":"article"},"doc://Readium/documentation/Readium/Preferences":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/Readium\/Preferences","kind":"article","title":"Configuring the Navigator","abstract":[{"text":"Take a look at the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"..\/Migration%20Guide.md","type":"reference"},{"text":" if you are already using the legacy EPUB settings.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/readium\/preferences","role":"article"},"doc://Readium/documentation/Readium/Migration-Guide":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/Readium\/Migration-Guide","kind":"article","title":"Migration Guide","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"All migration steps necessary in reading apps to upgrade to major versions of the Swift Readium toolkit will be documented in this file."}],"url":"\/documentation\/readium\/migration-guide","role":"article"},"doc://Readium/documentation/Readium/Search":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/Readium\/Search","kind":"article","title":"Searching a publication","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Search API lets you look for a textual query in the content of a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Publication"},{"type":"text","text":". EPUB and PDF publications are supported."}],"url":"\/documentation\/readium\/search","role":"article"},"../Migration%20Guide.md":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type